  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: 7*10*5*6*4*15\n\nAccording to the question, after replacing the signs:\n\nOption 1) ÷, –, ×, +, =\n\n7 * 10 * 5 * 6 * 4 * 15 ⇒ 7 ÷ 10 - 5 × 6 + 4 = 15\n\n⇒ __**7 ÷**____** 10**__ - 5 × 6 + 4 = 15\n\n⇒ 0.7 - __**5 **____**×**____** 6**__ + 4 = 15\n\n⇒ __**0.**____**7 + 4**__ - 30 = 15\n\n⇒ __4.____7____** - 30**__ = 15\n\n⇒ -25.3 ≠",
